s://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695260/extras/bca289ee61e8d23c6bf0e27f2e4b86de.webm?t=1703141629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695260/extras/bca289ee61e8d23c6bf0e27f2e4b86de.mp4?t=1703141629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Each biome has its own roster of fierce enemies. The challenge ramps up the further you progress, with each mob type adding its own deadly fighting style to further complicate the challenging traversals you must attempt. Brace yourself, as these enemies will only grow in ferocity...<br><br><br><strong><i>Features</i></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>50 Enemy Types </li><li> 10 Challenging Bosses </li><li> Over 5 Biomes </li><li> Cooking and Potions </li><li> Deep Story </li><li>Feed all 30 hidden pigs </li><li> Hidden boss </li><li> Hidden rooms </li><li> Chip-tune soundtrack </li><li> Pimped-out NES Graphics </li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695260/extras/2d1636b7e758bf8885fcc430bcb98db1.poster.avif?t=1703141629\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695260/extras/2d1636b7e758bf8885fcc430bcb98db1.apng?t=1703141629\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
